# ── Application ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public base URL of the deployed site (no trailing slash). Used for
# canonical URLs, Open Graph tags, and the sitemap.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ── Database (MySQL) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Format: mysql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DATABASE
# On Hostinger, create a MySQL database + user from hPanel, then use
# those credentials here.
DATABASE_URL="mysql://user:password@localhost:3306/ash_kash"

# ── Authentication ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Long random string used to sign session cookies (JWT). Generate one with:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET="replace-with-a-long-random-string"

# Password for the admin user created by the seed. Change this before
# seeding a production database, then change the password again from the
# admin panel after first login.
SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD="ChangeMe123!"

# Optional: set this to enable a one-time, token-gated seed endpoint at
# /api/deploy/seed?token=YOUR_TOKEN — useful on hosts (like Hostinger shared
# Node.js hosting) where SSH/terminal access to run `npm run db:seed` isn't
# convenient. Visit the URL once in your browser to seed the database, then
# remove this variable so the endpoint stops working.
# DEPLOY_SEED_TOKEN="pick-a-long-random-string"

# ── Image storage ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# "local" stores uploads in /public/uploads (works out of the box,
# recommended for most Hostinger deployments). "s3" is a placeholder
# for S3-compatible object storage (see src/lib/storage.ts) — requires
# installing @aws-sdk/client-s3 and implementing the upload function.
IMAGE_STORAGE="local"
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# AWS_REGION=
# AWS_BUCKET_NAME=
# AWS_ENDPOINT=

# ── Email (transactional) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Not tightly coupled to any provider — wire your provider of choice
# into src/lib/email.ts (order confirmations, password resets, etc).
# EMAIL_PROVIDER="resend" | "postmark" | "smtp"
# EMAIL_API_KEY=
# EMAIL_FROM="Ash & Kash <hello@yourdomain.com>"

# ── Currency exchange rates ──────────────────────────────────────
# No configuration needed. Non-default currencies auto-refresh their rate
# from the free open.er-api.com API (no API key) once a day in the
# background, or instantly via "Sync Live Rates Now" in Admin → Currencies.
# Turn off "Auto-update" per currency to pin its rate manually instead.

# ── Optional: paid geolocation API ───────────────────────────────
# The app detects visitor country from CDN/proxy headers (Cloudflare's
# CF-IPCountry, Vercel's x-vercel-ip-country) with no cost. Set this
# only if you plug in a paid IP geolocation service instead.
# GEOLOCATION_API_KEY=
